{"id":"0c69d90905f0a579b0f298c2dcdc255fefb8747c","url":"https://www.biom.dev/","title":"Visual Workspace for AI Automations","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"www.biom.dev","byline":null,"excerpt":"Where the work your agents do lands: a page that draws what they wrote, synced everywhere, open to your team and their agents.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n\n<section aria-label=\"Biom\">\n  \n\n  <nav>\n    <a href=\"#\" id=\"wordmark\"><img src=\"assets/logo/biom-wordmark.png\" alt=\"Biom\"></a>\n    <span>\n      <a href=\"pricing.html\" id=\"navPricing\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Tx2hr6DzAR\" id=\"navDiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/marks/discord.svg\" alt=\"\"><span>Discord</span></a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/jesse51002/Biom\" id=\"navGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/marks/github.svg\" alt=\"\"><span>GitHub</span></a>\n      <a href=\"get-started.html\" id=\"navCta\">Get started</a>\n    </span>\n  </nav>\n\n  \n\n\n  \n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"digestHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"digestHeading\">Your daily digest</h2>\n  \n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"alwaysHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"alwaysHeading\">Agents always working</h2>\n  \n</section>\n\n<!-- HIDDEN FOR NOW: a prompt typed and a page printing in under it, three on a loop. Uncomment to bring it\n     back; its code is behind has('.picture') and its copy is still in copy.js.\n<section class=\"picture\" aria-labelledby=\"pictureHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"pictureHeading\">Tools and automations in one prompt</h2>\n  <p class=\"ask\"><span class=\"prompt\">›</span> <span id=\"typed\"></span><span class=\"caret\"></span></p>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"pageFrame\"></div>\n</section>\n-->\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"vizHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"vizHeading\">Create with agents</h2>\n  <p id=\"vizLine\">A design document</p>\n  \n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"togetherHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"togetherHeading\">Humans and agents working together</h2>\n  \n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"brainHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"brainHeading\"><span id=\"brainBefore\"></span> <span id=\"brainSwap\"><span id=\"brainWord\"></span></span> <span id=\"brainAfter\"></span></h2>\n  <div aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <p><span><span>›</span> <span id=\"askText\"></span><span></span></span></p>\n      \n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"folderHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"folderHeading\">Let us manage it, or bring your agents.</h2>\n  \n</section>\n\n<!-- HIDDEN FOR NOW: the board of nine kinds a workspace holds. Uncomment to bring it back; its code is\n     behind has('.everything') and its copy is still in copy.js.\n<section class=\"everything\" aria-labelledby=\"everythingHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"everythingHeading\">Your single source of truth</h2>\n  <div class=\"board\" id=\"board\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n-->\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"closeHeading\">\n  \n  <h2 id=\"closeHeading\">Visual Workspace for AI Automations</h2>\n  <a href=\"get-started.html\" id=\"closeCta\">Get started</a>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</DIV>","content_text":"Pricing Discord GitHub Get started Your daily digest Agents always working Create with agents A design document Humans and agents working together › Let us manage it, or bring your agents. Visual Workspace for AI Automations Get started","fetched_at":"2026-09-16T22:13:41.018Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"digestHeading\">Your daily digest</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Your daily digest","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"alwaysHeading\">Agents always working</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Agents always working","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"vizHeading\">Create with agents</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Create with agents","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p id=\"vizLine\">A design document</p>","sentences":[{"en":"A design document","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"togetherHeading\">Humans and agents working together</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Humans and agents working together","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"folderHeading\">Let us manage it, or bring your agents.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Let us manage it, or bring your agents.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"closeHeading\">Visual Workspace for AI Automations</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Visual Workspace for AI Automations","zh":null}]}],"translated":false}